# Jaguar XJ6 Series 1-3 four-door saloon, 1968-1987.
#
# The XJ6: 4,826 mm long (Series 3 4,955 mm), 1,771 mm wide, 1,334 mm high
# (Series 3 1,375 mm), 2,769 mm wheelbase; 2.8/3.4/4.2 sixes. Series 1 1968-73,
# Series 2 1973-79, Series 3 1979-87. The class-3/4 executive Jaguar of the 1970s
# and 1980s. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar_XJ
#
# Colours: British Racing Green, Silver, Sapphire Blue and Black are documented
# Jaguar finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 70 in total (green 22, silver 18, blue 16, black 14).
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 130/375 (line). Classes 3,4.
# Dates: 1968-1987 with a road tail to about 1997.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/jaguar-xj6-series1.blend. References:
# citycars/references/jaguar-xj6-series1/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

